<title>USA: Sioux City steers up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City steers up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared with Monday, slaughter steers were $0.50 higher on a thin test. Trade moderate. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers - Choice 2-3, 1175-1225 lbs 66.50-66.75.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers - no trade.</p>
